            <div xml:id="d549">

                <pb facs="0634" n="532" sameAs="frus:frus1933v03/pg532"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/12472: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China (Johnson) to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-09-26T15:00:00+08:00">September 26, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 26—4:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>770. Legation’s 753, September 18, 11 a.m. Following from American Consul at
                    Foochow: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“September 25, 11 a.m. My September 15, 3 p.m. American Dominican
                            Procuration reports that Padres Curran, Werner, and Grace have arrived
                            safely at Hangchow, Chekiang.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
